@startuml
state Initial
state LoggedIn
state Teacher
state Student
state QuizCompleted

Initial --> LoggedIn

LoggedIn -> Teacher: Continue as teacher
LoggedIn -> Student: Continue as student

Teacher --> QuizCreated
QuizCreated --> QuizEdited
QuizEdited --> save draft
QuizEdited --> post quiz

Student --> QuizSelected
QuizSelected --> AnsweringQuiz
AnsweringQuiz --> SubmitQuiz
SubmitQuiz --> ViewResult

QuizCompleted --> [*]
@enduml
